sg-office-editors (8.2.0.143+sg2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The editors' "new feature" tips (Spreadsheets' "Updated Pivot Tables"
    on every start) are marked seen: build/assemble-app.sh lists the tips
    this build of the editors has (sg-seen-tips.js), and editor.html marks
    them in the editors' storage before an editor loads. Test: make test-deb
    (the list is in the package; mutant "tips": test-deb-mutation). VM: the
    tip on every start with +sg1, never with this build.

